Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030, 0035)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, tommo, Zero_Amamiya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:00.71,italics,,0,0,0,,You can cure a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:03.84,general text,,0,0,0,,and make him human, even if he went wild?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.18,0:01:08.18,general text,,0,0,0,,We are not trying to make him human again
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:12.73,general text,,0,0,0,,We are trying to keep him conscious so that he can speak
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.15,0:01:18.73,general text,,0,0,0,,So you’re not trying to save him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:21.99,general text,,0,0,0,,When a nomad turns into a souleater, there is no turning back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.95,0:01:24.24,general text,,0,0,0,,They are monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:29.03,italics,,0,0,0,,Either they will feed on human energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:31.29,italics,,0,0,0,,or they will petrify. One of two
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:40.30,general text,,0,0,0,,We are unable to prevent this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:45.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:50.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that he has the power of Hwangsu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.35,0:01:52.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Can a stone stop circulation?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:55.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Possibly. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.19,0:02:01.03,general text,,0,0,0,,people should not use such power under any circumstances
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.58,0:02:16.37,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems like it’s going to rain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:21.30,general text,,0,0,0,,And I couldn’t use the power of the reflectors
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:24.34,general text,,0,0,0,,It looks like everything will be washed away by the rain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:27.38,general text,,0,0,0,,When it rains, does the reflector's power disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.47,0:02:30.05,general text,,0,0,0,,The power of the ice stone came from heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:32.72,general text,,0,0,0,,So heaven can take this power
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.91,0:02:56.62,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Did she try to call upon the power of heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:59.17,offscreen,,0,0,0,,to hide the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.92,0:03:05.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Bu Young
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:09.97,general text,,0,0,0,,If she were alive, she would become a powerful priestess,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.51,0:03:13.22,general text,,0,0,0,,which can control the power of heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.37,0:03:38.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:42.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm fine too. You haven't gone wild
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.15,0:04:03.02,general text,,0,0,0,,The gate above the bowl of constellations has opened
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.69,0:04:05.98,general text,,0,0,0,,- And the ceiling wasn’t always like this?\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.53,0:04:08.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone thinks so,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:10.78,general text,,0,0,0,,but I was told that this is not so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:13.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Who? Your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:17.75,general text,,0,0,0,,He said to open the gate above the bowl
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.83,0:04:20.29,general text,,0,0,0,,only an astrologer magician can
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:22.67,general text,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:26.00,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems we did something we shouldn’t have
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:27.42,italics,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:30.51,italics,,0,0,0,,It’s me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.59,0:04:33.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I opened the gate
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:36.85,general text,,0,0,0,,My energy leaked into the water
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.68,0:04:39.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Like at Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.27,0:04:41.89,general text,,0,0,0,,and in the mirror of Tosca
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.77,0:04:46.02,general text,,0,0,0,,My energy returned thanks to this water
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:06.46,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you mean lightning struck?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:08.59,general text,,0,0,0,,A loud sound came from the recording room
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:12.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Eunuch Kim and Chan Wook are there now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.47,0:05:22.35,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the power of the reflector
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:25.94,general text,,0,0,0,,The same dark energy as when Kil Ju tried to exchange bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:29.61,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:33.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t see anything, as in the case of the mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.78,0:05:35.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Dizzy and nauseous
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:37.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu will come soon, we must leave
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:51.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly. door
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:56.39,general text,,0,0,0,,He closed the door with energy, the bowl of constellations is broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.47,0:05:57.89,general text,,0,0,0,,and the souleater is dead
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:00.39,general text,,0,0,0,,We have problems
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.18,0:06:03.64,general text,,0,0,0,,There is an exit for servants next to the bowl of constellations
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:06.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Father led me through this door
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:09.44,general text,,0,0,0,,But we will still be in Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.74,0:06:16.61,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t see, and I don’t know the way
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:21.37,general text,,0,0,0,,If we get lost, we will be caught
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.45,0:06:23.70,general text,,0,0,0,,We stay here - Jin Mu will come and kill us
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.79,0:06:25.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t win against him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.21,0:06:31.96,general text,,0,0,0,,We must call my savior
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:35.09,general text,,0,0,0,,- Savior?\N- There is one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.05,0:06:40.64,general text,,0,0,0,,His heart will tremble, and he will come immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:42.76,general text,,0,0,0,,My savior
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:09.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, are you kidding me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:16.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you hear a loud sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.63,0:07:19.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, but you said not to enter, so we waited
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:22.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Yom Soo, follow me. The others are guarding the door
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook broke the barrier and escaped
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.45,0:07:41.28,italics,,0,0,0,,Deputy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:43.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Bowl of constellations...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:46.41,general text,,0,0,0,,What happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.45,0:07:49.00,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to find it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:50.96,general text,,0,0,0,,We can’t let him out of here alive
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:53.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Move the body to the secret room
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:56.05,general text,,0,0,0,,- No one should see you\N{\i1}- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Close all exits
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.89,0:08:06.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Find Chan Wook and his maid
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.31,0:08:09.77,general text,,0,0,0,,If something happens, you can kill them
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.85,0:08:10.81,italics,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.49,0:08:29.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook will never get out of this labyrinth
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:31.96,general text,,0,0,0,,He will get lost and will be caught
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:35.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:40.17,general text,,0,0,0,,he knew he would get lost, so he just hid inside
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.51,0:08:45.26,general text,,0,0,0,,You almost got it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.47,0:08:47.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:51.52,general text,,0,0,0,,You broke the barrier that I made
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:53.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's do another one. Fiery
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.44,0:08:58.07,general text,,0,0,0,,If I set this place on fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:09:00.90,general text,,0,0,0,,it will probably be quite hot,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.61,0:09:03.28,general text,,0,0,0,,to make you appear
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:07.41,italics,,0,0,0,,Try to convince me as before, without threats
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:11.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Why, if I have nothing to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:15.96,general text,,0,0,0,,You are a criminal who entered here without permission and also broke the cup
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:18.09,general text,,0,0,0,,And my job is to catch the criminal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:20.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I am the deputy of Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:26.26,general text,,0,0,0,,You are too cruel to the guest who came with a gift
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.34,0:09:29.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Upset that we turned your friend to stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.89,0:09:30.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Which friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.77,0:09:36.19,general text,,0,0,0,,There was no one here except you two and me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.86,0:09:39.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah-ah... want to hide a stone body?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.07,0:09:41.36,italics,,0,0,0,,But what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.69,0:09:45.36,general text,,0,0,0,,- You will be caught\N- {\u0\i1}This will not happen
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:48.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Because you and your maid will die
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.79,0:09:50.91,italics,,0,0,0,,Get out
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:52.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:21.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:24.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Lightning struck near Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.19,0:10:26.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Jeonbugwan next to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:29.53,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to check if everything is okay
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:31.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Lightning struck so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:33.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope, straight from Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.30,0:10:50.47,general text,,0,0,0,,What a shame
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.47,0:10:54.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I probably came here happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.18,0:10:56.39,general text,,0,0,0,,imagining that you will become Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:58.06,general text,,0,0,0,,But instead you will die
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.15,0:10:59.90,italics,,0,0,0,,You're out of luck
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:02.40,general text,,0,0,0,,This won’t work
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:04.28,general text,,0,0,0,,If I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.36,0:11:06.61,general text,,0,0,0,,you can easily become Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:08.28,general text,,0,0,0,,And this should not be allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:09.36,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:13.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you heard about yin-yang jade?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:17.62,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a pair of red and blue jade
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:20.29,general text,,0,0,0,,If you pour energy into one stone, the second will feel it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:21.71,general text,,0,0,0,,If they are nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:24.55,general text,,0,0,0,,they will find each other
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.80,0:11:26.76,general text,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:28.30,general text,,0,0,0,,One of two stones, blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:31.14,general text,,0,0,0,,now with the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:34.35,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Dear jade
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.43,0:11:36.98,memories,,0,0,0,,I received it in exchange for toads
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:38.23,memories,,0,0,0,,Is he valuable?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.23,0:11:42.02,general text,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:44.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I had red
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.40,0:11:46.94,general text,,0,0,0,,I poured energy into him, which means His Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:49.40,general text,,0,0,0,,on the way here now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.33,0:12:01.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you kill me and take the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.46,0:12:05.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought so, so I hid the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:10.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Filled it with energy and hid it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:12.18,general text,,0,0,0,,in the robe of a eunuch soul swallower
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:25.65,italics,,0,0,0,,His Highness is probably now in a hurry to the stone body
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.99,0:12:31.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Imagine his reaction when he sees this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:34.82,general text,,0,0,0,,He will be more than surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:48.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:52.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook somewhere in Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.39,0:13:02.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t waste your time killing me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:04.90,general text,,0,0,0,,better stop the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:11.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:14.70,general text,,0,0,0,,You still won’t be able to escape from here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.46,0:13:28.46,general text,,0,0,0,,- Where is the body?\N- In the secret room
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:31.09,general text,,0,0,0,,If you order, I will take it out of there
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.85,0:13:42.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Where...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:48.61,general text,,0,0,0,,He is not here. This bastard fooled me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.57,0:13:53.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Deputy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.11,0:13:55.91,general text,,0,0,0,,You ordered not to let anyone in, but there was no choice
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.49,0:13:59.16,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Is the Crown Prince here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:00.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.33,0:14:04.50,general text,,0,0,0,,So he didn’t lie about jade
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.18,0:14:22.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Deputy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.31,0:14:25.39,general text,,0,0,0,,The royal eunuch turned into a soulswallow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:31.19,general text,,0,0,0,,And you tried to secretly kill Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.27,0:14:33.19,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a misunderstanding, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:11.52,general text,,0,0,0,,You tried
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.61,0:15:14.23,general text,,0,0,0,,feed my maid to this soul swallower
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:18.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Better give a normal explanation of what is happening
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:33.50,general text,,0,0,0,,You are asking about Cho Chun, who worked
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:35.80,general text,,0,0,0,,astrogazer in Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:40.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that Chang Gang and Cho Chun were close
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:41.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.93,0:15:43.60,general text,,0,0,0,,They were good friends
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:45.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Chun often visited us
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:50.06,general text,,0,0,0,,He was a cheerful and kind person
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:52.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Chun used dark magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.94,0:15:55.57,general text,,0,0,0,,which destroyed his entire family
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.65,0:15:57.24,general text,,0,0,0,,He was a good man
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:16:01.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I still can’t believe that this happened
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:06.66,general text,,0,0,0,,He had a daughter. Did you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:09.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I remember her
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:13.25,general text,,0,0,0,,She was always with her father, they were close
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.33,0:16:15.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard she was missing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:17.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.09,0:16:19.47,general text,,0,0,0,,she is dead
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.47,0:16:22.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you decide this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:26.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Chang Gan was looking for this girl for a very long time
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:30.98,general text,,0,0,0,,If she were alive, he would have found her already
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.06,0:16:33.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Unless it was hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:35.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Miss Do Hwa died
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:38.69,general text,,0,0,0,,This happened to his best friend
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:41.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Chan was not himself then
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.53,0:16:45.91,general text,,0,0,0,,He blamed himself for both deaths
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:48.16,general text,,0,0,0,,and suffered a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:51.83,general text,,0,0,0,,He left the house in search of his friend's daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.92,0:16:54.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought he would return when he found her
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:16:55.67,general text,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:17:00.26,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s strange that he left home for 20 years to find a girl
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.05,0:17:03.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to suspect that he left
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:05.26,general text,,0,0,0,,for another reason
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:09.47,general text,,0,0,0,,If he had found that girl 20 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:12.89,general text,,0,0,0,,her life wouldn’t be so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.98,0:17:16.94,general text,,0,0,0,,And Chang Gan would not feel guilty
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.02,0:17:18.57,general text,,0,0,0,,"Blame"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.65,0:17:22.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you implying that Master Chan behaved incorrectly towards his friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.24,0:17:25.32,italics,,0,0,0,,He punished him for dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.41,0:17:27.37,general text,,0,0,0,,As a magician, he had to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:31.54,general text,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t matter how close they were, it was impossible otherwise
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:35.88,general text,,0,0,0,,You cannot judge what is true and what is not based on what you have seen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:38.96,general text,,0,0,0,,There is a story behind everything
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.05,0:17:42.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Fate is woven from stories and relationships
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:44.22,general text,,0,0,0,,That is, painful relationships
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.30,0:17:49.22,general text,,0,0,0,,the Cho and Chan families are not over?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.89,0:17:51.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Or you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.93,0:17:56.90,general text,,0,0,0,,are you saying that that girl is in this house now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:18:00.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor found her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.74,0:18:04.07,general text,,0,0,0,,That girl
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.36,0:18:07.53,general text,,0,0,0,,died
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:14.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.91,0:18:16.08,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.29,0:18:19.25,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to hold her wake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.59,0:18:23.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:26.43,general text,,0,0,0,,You are very kind
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.51,0:18:28.47,italics,,0,0,0,,This is not a gesture of kindness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.55,0:18:31.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I just don’t want her spirit to end up in this world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.27,0:18:33.73,general text,,0,0,0,,and tormented the young master
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.31,0:18:38.61,general text,,0,0,0,,What if her spirit is haunting Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.69,0:18:41.65,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to get rid of it. This must be an evil spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:43.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t allow her to pursue him
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:46.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Evil spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.99,0:18:52.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is Moo Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.62,0:18:53.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.41,0:18:57.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I sent her to Jeonbugwan on an errand
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.63,0:19:06.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Can you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.80,0:19:08.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:10.30,general text,,0,0,0,,And you, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.39,0:19:12.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you injured anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:13.85,italics,,0,0,0,,I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.93,0:19:16.31,memories,,0,0,0,,What does it mean if two people keep a matching item?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.39,0:19:18.60,memories,,0,0,0,,That they are married or dating
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:25.19,general text,,0,0,0,,The Head of Sosnovy Bor has arrived on your order
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:47.51,general text,,0,0,0,,You have arrived in Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:50.93,general text,,0,0,0,,pass honey cookies to the deputy??
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.01,0:19:54.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. I heard you were fighting over them
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:19:57.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim didn’t want him to be upset,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.85,0:19:59.85,general text,,0,0,0,,so I came to deliver her package
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:01.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Pathetic excuse
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:03.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Head of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.65,0:20:06.65,general text,,0,0,0,,and the deputy of Gwangju were quarreling over cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:10.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Even if this is true, it was worth keeping silent about it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.78,0:20:12.99,general text,,0,0,0,,What were you doing in the recording room?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.07,0:20:15.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see the bowl of constellations
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.49,0:20:18.29,general text,,0,0,0,,But in the end I saw something that I shouldn’t have
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:23.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you saw the soul swallower?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:26.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. He put a barrier around me to hide it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.75,0:20:29.30,general text,,0,0,0,,and threw Moo Dok to him so that he could get enough
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:30.84,general text,,0,0,0,,He's lying
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.47,0:20:35.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook entered the recording room without permission
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:37.52,general text,,0,0,0,,and broke the bowl of constellations
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:39.93,general text,,0,0,0,,And when he was caught,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:42.94,general text,,0,0,0,,started to come up with all sorts of things about the soul swallower
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.81,0:20:46.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was a soul swallower
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.61,0:20:48.57,general text,,0,0,0,,He turned to stone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.65,0:20:50.78,general text,,0,0,0,,My maid saw it too
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.86,0:20:52.95,general text,,0,0,0,,When I arrived, I didn’t see the body
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.03,0:20:54.62,general text,,0,0,0,,He probably hid it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:56.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Seal all exits
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:20:59.37,general text,,0,0,0,,and find the soul swallower before he takes him out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:06.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I think the truth will be revealed when we find the body
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.51,0:21:12.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I will call the magicians to inspect Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.51,0:21:15.93,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t do that. I can't let them do this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.01,0:21:18.35,general text,,0,0,0,,because of someone’s baseless lie
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:25.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:28.52,general text,,0,0,0,,was the royal eunuch the soul swallower?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.61,0:21:29.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.57,0:21:33.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw him with the queen when we had a duel
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:35.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Eunuch Oh, who was there that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.91,0:21:38.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Eunuch Kim. He serves the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:42.83,general text,,0,0,0,,So, we need to check whether he is in the palace now or not
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.41,0:21:45.04,italics,,0,0,0,,Go check
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.17,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.36,0:22:11.61,italics,,0,0,0,,The Queen has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.69,0:22:13.28,italics,,0,0,0,,Greet her
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.91,0:22:21.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.33,0:22:25.62,general text,,0,0,0,,The deputy told me about what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.71,0:22:27.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I was surprised, so I came in person
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:34.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Did they really find a soul swallower here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.88,0:22:37.26,italics,,0,0,0,,The eunuch who served you was a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.34,0:22:39.93,general text,,0,0,0,,He has gone wild and petrified here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:44.02,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is that so?\N- This is not true
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.60,0:22:46.98,general text,,0,0,0,,No one here turned to stone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.06,0:22:48.27,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.56,0:22:51.23,general text,,0,0,0,,which was invented by Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.32,0:22:55.95,general text,,0,0,0,,We will know if this is true or false when we find out where the eunuch is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.78,0:23:02.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is this eunuch who allegedly turned to stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.70,0:23:05.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Eunuch Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.59,0:23:15.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Eunuch Kim arrived here with me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.73,0:23:28.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Eunuch Kim, enter
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.68,0:24:03.22,general text,,0,0,0,,This eunuch
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.30,0:24:06.22,general text,,0,0,0,,you saw
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.81,0:24:08.47,general text,,0,0,0,,petrified?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.23,0:24:11.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.35,0:24:13.98,italics,,0,0,0,,You said he went wild
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.06,0:24:16.40,general text,,0,0,0,,But he stands here alive and well
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.82,0:24:19.07,general text,,0,0,0,,You are right
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.07,0:24:24.62,general text,,0,0,0,,He's fine
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.29,0:24:35.46,italics,,0,0,0,,The only way to resolve this is,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.46,0:24:41.01,general text,,0,0,0,,bring him back to life
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.15,0:24:58.77,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He's fine, completely fine
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.90,0:25:01.94,voiceover,,0,0,0,,If this is the power of the ice stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.03,0:25:04.49,voiceover,,0,0,0,,which means I can save Moo Deok, even if she goes wild
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.41,0:25:06.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.70,0:25:09.58,general text,,0,0,0,,we must have made a mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.41,0:25:12.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably the owner
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.04,0:25:17.63,general text,,0,0,0,,You are not mistaken. You lied
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.71,0:25:19.80,general text,,0,0,0,,He is standing here alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.67,0:25:22.84,general text,,0,0,0,,it turns out I really was lying
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.30,0:25:29.26,general text,,0,0,0,,He tried to fool everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.35,0:25:32.56,general text,,0,0,0,,because I broke the cup of constellations
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.64,0:25:33.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.23,0:25:36.98,general text,,0,0,0,,is this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.61,0:25:42.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Everything I said is a lie
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.07,0:25:48.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I made my way to Jeonbugwan, broke the relic,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.37,0:25:52.20,general text,,0,0,0,,and then lied to hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.29,0:25:55.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.71,0:25:59.46,general text,,0,0,0,,He is a magician of Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.54,0:26:02.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I personally apologize for it
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.09,0:26:07.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I apologize to Deputy Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.18,0:26:15.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Pine forest will repair the bowl
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.19,0:26:19.40,general text,,0,0,0,,No need
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.48,0:26:20.69,italics,,0,0,0,,Don’t refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.77,0:26:23.23,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the only way we can be held responsible for this
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.94,0:26:26.40,general text,,0,0,0,,- Not worth\N- Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.99,0:26:29.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Let Sosnovy Bor correct the error
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.95,0:26:33.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Let them, mother
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.54,0:26:37.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Do as you please
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.54,0:26:40.63,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s time for me to go back
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.44,0:27:06.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I will send my people tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.49,0:27:08.36,general text,,0,0,0,,to repair the broken bowl
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.11,0:27:12.41,general text,,0,0,0,,And now I must return to properly punish the magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.49,0:27:15.70,general text,,0,0,0,,who lied to the prince and the people of Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.75,0:27:18.21,general text,,0,0,0,,- Forward\N- This won’t work
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.91,0:27:22.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook will stay and be punished here
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.46,0:27:29.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I think so too...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.26,0:27:32.09,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.89,0:27:34.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Save my master
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.22,0:27:37.39,general text,,0,0,0,,If he is taken to Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.06,0:27:43.81,general text,,0,0,0,,he will be beaten to death there
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.19,0:27:47.69,italics,,0,0,0,,Last time
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.78,0:27:49.90,general text,,0,0,0,,he received a hundred blows
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.61,0:27:52.70,general text,,0,0,0,,This time it will be worse
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.78,0:27:54.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t let this happen
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.91,0:27:58.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, that's enough
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.12,0:28:03.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I did wrong and will be punished
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.88,0:28:09.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I did not show due respect to His Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.63,0:28:13.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I dare not ask for mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.51,0:28:17.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Then let them take you and kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.06,0:28:20.27,general text,,0,0,0,,If the head wants it, then yes
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.15,0:28:23.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.94,0:28:31.40,general text,,0,0,0,,You can pick me up
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.82,0:28:35.57,general text,,0,0,0,,How so, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.66,0:28:37.28,general text,,0,0,0,,You will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.91,0:28:41.96,general text,,0,0,0,,You will die if you return to Sosnovy Bor!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.58,0:28:49.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I will punish him as required by the set of rules
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.26,0:28:54.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, you. Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.47,0:29:01.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook will be punished,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.60,0:29:03.23,general text,,0,0,0,,forget about what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.27,0:29:05.81,general text,,0,0,0,,This is just funny
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.90,0:29:06.94,general text,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.48,0:29:09.98,general text,,0,0,0,,the cookie story is even worse
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.69,0:29:13.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Head of Pine Forest and Deputy of Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.40,0:29:15.03,general text,,0,0,0,,quarrel over cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.99,0:29:16.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Just laughing
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.74,0:29:19.16,general text,,0,0,0,,The stupidest excuse
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.99,0:29:21.83,general text,,0,0,0,,You are right
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.25,0:29:26.17,general text,,0,0,0,,But how did the bowl of constellations break?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.13,0:29:31.09,general text,,0,0,0,,If lightning struck,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.17,0:29:33.63,general text,,0,0,0,,meaning the gate above the bowl has opened
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.72,0:29:36.93,general text,,0,0,0,,But only those who have mastered Chisa can do this
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.93,0:29:39.14,general text,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.27,0:29:44.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook does not own Chisu
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.98,0:29:51.02,general text,,0,0,0,,How did the cup break?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.99,0:30:00.95,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Was there anyone else here who owns Chisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.70,0:30:03.37,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,This is impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.89,0:30:23.14,general text,,0,0,0,,We got out of there thanks to you, Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.22,0:30:25.02,general text,,0,0,0,,If you try to leave, they will stop you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.10,0:30:27.27,general text,,0,0,0,,And if you decide to stay, they’ll try to drive you away
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.35,0:30:31.15,general text,,0,0,0,,So you staged this performance on purpose? Smart
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.23,0:30:34.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I decided that you won’t convince them,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.23,0:30:36.45,general text,,0,0,0,,so I intervened without permission
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.53,0:30:38.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry for intruding
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.41,0:30:42.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect this, so I was surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.49,0:30:45.66,general text,,0,0,0,,But you’re great
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.33,0:30:48.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.62,0:30:50.58,general text,,0,0,0,,We didn’t lie
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.67,0:30:54.34,general text,,0,0,0,,We saw how the eunuch Kim became wild and petrified
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.42,0:30:55.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I know they didn’t lie
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.34,0:30:58.72,italics,,0,0,0,,At times I’m not thinking clearly,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.80,0:31:00.68,general text,,0,0,0,,but I can distinguish a lie from the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.64,0:31:03.39,italics,,0,0,0,,He was petrified, but came to his senses
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.47,0:31:07.10,general text,,0,0,0,,So they have an ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.89,0:31:09.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.52,0:31:13.27,general text,,0,0,0,,watches Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.94,0:31:15.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is as we expected
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.74,0:31:19.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I guess they have the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.70,0:31:29.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you use the stone to revive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.66,0:31:32.00,general text,,0,0,0,,His strength is simply amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.00,0:31:35.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I really feel alive
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.76,0:31:40.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook turned you to stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.05,0:31:44.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Energy suddenly began to leave my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.76,0:31:48.68,general text,,0,0,0,,when I was about to get enough of his maid
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.60,0:31:50.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I lost consciousness
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.15,0:31:55.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you seen how Chang Wook opened the roof over the bowl of constellations?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.36,0:31:57.57,general text,,0,0,0,,No, I haven’t seen it
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.82,0:32:01.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe there was another magician there besides Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.32,0:32:03.57,general text,,0,0,0,,None
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.74,0:32:06.91,general text,,0,0,0,,What if Chang Wook has already possessed Chisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.66,0:32:08.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he’s just hiding it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.66,0:32:14.29,general text,,0,0,0,,When he attacked me, he didn’t look particularly skilled
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.38,0:32:17.50,general text,,0,0,0,,He mastered Ryusu in an incredibly short time
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.34,0:32:19.67,general text,,0,0,0,,So it's possible
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.63,0:32:24.68,italics,,0,0,0,,Now there is an ice stone in me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.76,0:32:27.97,general text,,0,0,0,,does this mean that I own Hwansu?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.23,0:32:33.40,general text,,0,0,0,,You really have such power
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.44,0:32:37.32,general text,,0,0,0,,But you don’t know how to cast spells,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.40,0:32:40.28,general text,,0,0,0,,so you can’t use this power
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.95,0:32:48.79,general text,,0,0,0,,But the ice stone is mine now
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.87,0:32:51.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I brought you back to life for a while because we had no other choice
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.76,0:33:47.76,general text,,0,0,0,,So, stone
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.84,0:33:50.35,general text,,0,0,0,,can prevent the transformation of a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.31,0:33:52.85,general text,,0,0,0,,We must find him and destroy him
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.64,0:33:57.27,general text,,0,0,0,,We must destroy all the nomads, and he brings them back to life
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.35,0:33:59.19,general text,,0,0,0,,His power is truly terrible
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.86,0:34:01.90,general text,,0,0,0,,But this...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.74,0:34:07.24,italics,,0,0,0,,Uk, they will soon find out about your punishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.32,0:34:09.16,general text,,0,0,0,,so you can’t come back
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.87,0:34:11.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Stay at home for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.33,0:34:15.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, Moo Deok and I will go home
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.25,0:34:19.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Try not to catch the eye of Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.84,0:34:21.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.88,0:34:25.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.27,0:34:35.39,general text,,0,0,0,,He will get rid of the stone as soon as he receives it
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.48,0:34:37.39,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to find it earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.48,0:34:39.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Kil Ju was right
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.77,0:34:42.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Stone in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.02,0:34:46.19,general text,,0,0,0,,So Dan Zhu, who owns the stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.15,0:34:48.45,general text,,0,0,0,,this is that person
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.74,0:34:55.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Deal with everything quietly
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.20,0:34:57.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I will send the court lady Khan instead
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.87,0:35:00.08,general text,,0,0,0,,You will send messages through it
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.75,0:35:01.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I understand you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.63,0:35:06.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Because of what happened, Sosnovy Bor will now suspect me
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.38,0:35:12.01,general text,,0,0,0,,This happened because you underestimated Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.60,0:35:15.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t think he would free himself so quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.52,0:35:17.77,general text,,0,0,0,,He is a genius who instantly mastered Ryusu
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.85,0:35:20.02,general text,,0,0,0,,He was born with the energy of the King's star
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.10,0:35:21.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t immediately begin to underestimate him
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.69,0:35:24.32,italics,,0,0,0,,I thought he was special,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.40,0:35:27.19,general text,,0,0,0,,since he was born under the sign of such a star
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.28,0:35:30.53,general text,,0,0,0,,However, Chan Wook turned out to be a complete disappointment
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.61,0:35:33.33,general text,,0,0,0,,He was a simple boy, nothing outstanding
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.41,0:35:40.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Angry at the world, he hid his helplessness and laziness
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.17,0:35:44.29,general text,,0,0,0,,under the guise of composure. He never had a goal
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.88,0:35:47.34,italics,,0,0,0,,He was just a noble young man with high self-esteem,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.92,0:35:50.26,general text,,0,0,0,,so it was enough to serve him
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.22,0:35:53.14,general text,,0,0,0,,So it has changed
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.22,0:35:55.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought he was weak
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.93,0:35:58.73,general text,,0,0,0,,But he opened the gate of energy by drinking poison
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.81,0:36:02.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought he was just a braggart, but he really defeated the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.19,0:36:05.27,general text,,0,0,0,,What made him change so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.36,0:36:07.19,general text,,0,0,0,,People change
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.69,0:36:10.15,general text,,0,0,0,,for the sake of other people
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.45,0:36:14.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Find the one who appeared in his life shortly before all the changes
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.24,0:36:18.41,general text,,0,0,0,,This will be the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.29,0:36:25.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook was rejected by twelve teachers, but he still found his way
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.46,0:36:31.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Who could help him with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.89,0:36:37.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher, can we go to Danhyangok right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.81,0:36:41.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my punishment, we have time
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.02,0:36:43.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's practice in Danhyangk
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.85,0:36:46.65,general text,,0,0,0,,We can try to climb that tree
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.78,0:36:52.74,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s very cold in Danhyangk now
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.66,0:36:56.12,general text,,0,0,0,,If we get stuck there because of the snow,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.12,0:36:58.58,general text,,0,0,0,,we may die of hunger
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.66,0:37:01.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought it was warm there in winter and there was a lot of food
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.75,0:37:04.08,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that to Yulia last time
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.00,0:37:11.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I said that to calm him down
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.84,0:37:19.22,general text,,0,0,0,,He was worried that his pet bird had a hard time in winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.31,0:37:20.72,general text,,0,0,0,,so I lied
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.56,0:37:25.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about that bird that he called with his whistle when he was in Danhyangok?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.79,0:37:50.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu almost killed Wook?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.38,0:37:56.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I apologized for Uka and took him away from there
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.47,0:37:59.22,general text,,0,0,0,,But Jin Mu may try to harm him
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.35,0:38:05.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I insisted that we fix the constellation bowl,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.69,0:38:07.40,general text,,0,0,0,,so we will have access to Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.81,0:38:13.03,general text,,0,0,0,,You will go to Jeonbugwan with the workers of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.74,0:38:15.36,general text,,0,0,0,,and you will look after Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.74,0:38:18.07,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.42,0:38:28.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Sang Ho
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.58,0:38:32.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that Moo Deok was also in Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.42,0:38:34.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.17,0:38:35.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.97,0:38:42.64,general text,,0,0,0,,The nomad who went wild and turned to stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.72,0:38:44.56,general text,,0,0,0,,really back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.64,0:38:48.10,general text,,0,0,0,,So the chapter had to come back without saying anything
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.61,0:38:52.40,general text,,0,0,0,,How did Uk react to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.98,0:38:54.86,general text,,0,0,0,,It seemed that he was not surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.40,0:38:58.20,general text,,0,0,0,,He asked the head if the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.28,0:39:00.91,general text,,0,0,0,,bring the soulswallow back to life
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.99,0:39:03.03,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems he already knew about it
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.54,0:39:08.54,general text,,0,0,0,,So, he personally saw how the nomad came to life
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.62,0:39:11.08,general text,,0,0,0,,The head told him that they need to be destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.25,0:39:14.25,italics,,0,0,0,,And nomads and stone
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.34,0:39:16.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Get rid of everything that is evil
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.43,0:39:21.80,general text,,0,0,0,,And what did Uk answer to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.89,0:39:23.81,italics,,0,0,0,,This is just my guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.76,0:39:26.31,general text,,0,0,0,,but it seems he doesn’t agree with it
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.14,0:39:30.40,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook is always carefree and carefree
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.48,0:39:34.44,general text,,0,0,0,,But you can’t treat dark magic like that
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.53,0:39:37.49,italics,,0,0,0,,You and Uk are close
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.57,0:39:39.57,general text,,0,0,0,,You should warn him
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.75,0:39:54.25,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not only cold in Danhyangk,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.34,0:39:56.67,general text,,0,0,0,,there is no one there at all
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.55,0:39:59.88,general text,,0,0,0,,We can’t be alone now
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.72,0:40:02.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is this suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.97,0:40:06.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.77,0:40:10.31,general text,,0,0,0,,that I will absorb your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.89,0:40:14.15,general text,,0,0,0,,You have not gone wild. Nothing happened, even after our contact
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.23,0:40:16.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Because I absorbed the energy of that eunuch
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.15,0:40:18.57,italics,,0,0,0,,Everything is fine now,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.65,0:40:21.11,general text,,0,0,0,,but we don’t know when this might happen again
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.95,0:40:24.41,general text,,0,0,0,,If necessary,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.20,0:40:26.95,general text,,0,0,0,,you can run away or kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.41,0:40:31.33,general text,,0,0,0,,But if I absorb your energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.54,0:40:35.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t stand this
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.09,0:40:45.30,general text,,0,0,0,,What's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.97,0:40:47.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.26,0:40:49.60,general text,,0,0,0,,No, that’s not the point
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.56,0:40:53.73,general text,,0,0,0,,My heart fluttered
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.36,0:40:57.90,general text,,0,0,0,,These are your words
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.19,0:41:01.57,general text,,0,0,0,,carry more meaning than “I missed you”
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.61,0:41:06.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Shadow Warrior finally answered
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.33,0:41:10.95,general text,,0,0,0,,to my naive and sincere declaration of love
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.17,0:41:22.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I will find a stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.76,0:41:26.01,general text,,0,0,0,,so you never have to absorb my energy
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.06,0:41:35.19,general text,,0,0,0,,You will have to go against Park Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.27,0:41:38.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I will become as strong
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.49,0:41:45.49,general text,,0,0,0,,You lost nine battles in a row to the magicians of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.78,0:41:48.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Arrogant
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.41,0:41:54.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly, yin-yang jade. I have to return it
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.12,0:41:59.71,general text,,0,0,0,,But how did you call the Crown Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.59,0:42:03.80,general text,,0,0,0,,There is one way...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.88,0:42:06.59,general text,,0,0,0,,He makes my heart beat wildly
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.74,0:42:29.41,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, the alleged offender, did not have a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.87,0:42:33.83,general text,,0,0,0,,But Jin Mu had it, although he insisted on his innocence
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.67,0:42:48.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.22,0:42:51.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li, what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.18,0:42:53.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you not in Sosnovy Bor, but at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.47,0:42:56.06,general text,,0,0,0,,He is punished
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.48,0:43:00.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Punished? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.94,0:43:02.77,general text,,0,0,0,,What have you done this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.86,0:43:04.23,general text,,0,0,0,,No, it’s not like that
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.32,0:43:07.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim, don’t worry so much
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.24,0:43:08.57,italics,,0,0,0,,It’s like...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.99,0:43:11.99,general text,,0,0,0,,not real punishment
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.08,0:43:15.20,general text,,0,0,0,,It's more of a vacation disguised as a punishment
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.50,0:43:19.83,general text,,0,0,0,,It's true
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.33,0:43:22.38,italics,,0,0,0,,Good to hear
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.63,0:43:26.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Then we will fish on Lake Gyeongcheongdaeho
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.26,0:43:29.51,italics,,0,0,0,,Great idea
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.59,0:43:33.93,general text,,0,0,0,,You should rest here after spending time with Mr. Chan
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.06,0:43:38.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Impossible, maid Kim. I can't slack off now
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.73,0:43:40.10,italics,,0,0,0,,Master Li, sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.19,0:43:42.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I have already lost nine battles out of ten
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.81,0:43:44.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Last chance left to win
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.27,0:43:48.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm going to train. I hope for your understanding
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.36,0:43:52.41,general text,,0,0,0,,You suddenly became so diligent
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.49,0:43:55.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, my goal is to make maid Kim proud of me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.74,0:43:57.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I can't sit back and fish
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.96,0:44:02.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Lately your words touch my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.63,0:44:04.59,italics,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.67,0:44:06.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Forward to train
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.21,0:44:09.05,general text,,0,0,0,,And I will prepare you some sweets
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.81,0:44:20.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell the truth, why were you punished?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.02,0:44:27.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I broke the cup of constellations in Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.36,0:44:30.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t tell that to maid Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.28,0:44:33.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw lightning strike right above Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.32,0:44:34.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I guess she touched the cup
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.66,0:44:39.37,general text,,0,0,0,,We can’t tell you the details, but the owner is not to blame for anything
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.87,0:44:43.33,general text,,0,0,0,,The head of Sosnovy Bor will tell you the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.08,0:44:46.54,italics,,0,0,0,,I'll lend you my fishing rods
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.63,0:44:48.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I used to love fishing
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.55,0:44:51.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I have a couple of very good ones
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.22,0:44:52.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll bring it now
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.43,0:44:58.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.35,0:45:04.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to teach him how to catch a Goldfish
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.06,0:45:06.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Goldfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.69,0:45:10.19,general text,,0,0,0,,You’re talking about the one that can only be caught
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.28,0:45:11.86,italics,,0,0,0,,in Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.57,0:45:13.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.91,0:45:17.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard about her. Fish that is formed from the energy of the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.20,0:45:21.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that only magicians who have mastered Chisu or higher can catch her
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.50,0:45:23.66,general text,,0,0,0,,You really know a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.25,0:45:26.29,general text,,0,0,0,,When you caught this fish and control it
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.38,0:45:28.00,italics,,0,0,0,,energy of Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.55,0:45:30.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Pleasant feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.13,0:45:35.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Share this with the owner
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.84,0:45:36.84,general text,,0,0,0,,He’s busy
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.60,0:45:39.22,italics,,0,0,0,,Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.31,0:45:41.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li, take a look
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.27,0:45:43.35,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the best fishing rod, it's made of bamboo...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.43,0:45:45.98,general text,,0,0,0,,He is not busy, starting tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.06,0:45:48.94,general text,,0,0,0,,he will fish with you
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.48,0:45:52.49,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? I need to train
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.57,0:45:55.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you should not hold a sword, but a fishing rod
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.16,0:46:00.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Go to Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake and catch the Golden Fish
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.91,0:46:02.08,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.63,0:46:16.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Seems like a good place
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.72,0:46:18.14,general text,,0,0,0,,No, no, Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.84,0:46:22.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I used to fish here. The water is very cold
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.60,0:46:25.35,italics,,0,0,0,,There are no fish here because they have nothing to eat
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.89,0:46:28.90,general text,,0,0,0,,And we took bad fishing rods
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.98,0:46:32.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Goldfish must be caught with a fishing rod that bends easily
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.40,0:46:34.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Just like this
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.65,0:46:38.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this fish bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.45,0:46:40.62,general text,,0,0,0,,These are sweets
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.70,0:46:44.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim collected them for Master Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.83,0:46:47.75,general text,,0,0,0,,The maid Kim is a very kind woman
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.33,0:46:50.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is the bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.33,0:46:52.42,general text,,0,0,0,,We need worms or small fish
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.50,0:46:53.92,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.63,0:46:57.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you fish without bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.76,0:47:01.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you that the Golden Fish feeds on energy
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.80,0:47:04.47,italics,,0,0,0,,My energy will go along the bamboo stick
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.10,0:47:07.02,general text,,0,0,0,,and will serve as bait
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.60,0:47:09.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Your energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.69,0:47:13.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Master, repeat after the master
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.36,0:47:15.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.32,0:47:26.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you just need to control the energy of the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.45,0:47:28.66,general text,,0,0,0,,and wait for the Golden Fish to bite
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.17,0:47:37.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.84,0:47:40.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I feel like a fool. Do I have to continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.56,0:47:49.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Pecked!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.65,0:48:02.36,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the Golden Fish
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.03,0:48:06.66,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a clot of water that is formed from the energy of the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.33,0:48:10.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Only those who have mastered Chisu or higher are able to control water,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.66,0:48:12.33,general text,,0,0,0,,can catch her
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.04,0:48:16.46,italics,,0,0,0,,I haven’t fished for a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.55,0:48:19.84,general text,,0,0,0,,But I have to admit, it's still exciting to catch a Goldfish
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.13,0:48:24.68,general text,,0,0,0,,So this is not a real fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.26,0:48:27.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li didn’t bring you here to fish
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.27,0:48:31.31,general text,,0,0,0,,He is here to help you master Chisu
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.23,0:48:33.56,italics,,0,0,0,,Only those who have the strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.65,0:48:36.52,italics,,0,0,0,,can catch a clot of energy from Lake Gyeongcheongdaeho
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.61,0:48:39.36,general text,,0,0,0,,and master Chisu
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.15,0:48:42.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Chisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.91,0:48:53.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Slow
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.29,0:48:54.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Slow
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.25,0:48:57.25,general text,,0,0,0,,No, you're in too much of a hurry. Slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.96,0:48:59.46,general text,,0,0,0,,- Slow\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.52,0:49:14.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Jeonbugwan must have found another blind girl
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.81,0:49:17.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young says they bring blind girls
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.31,0:49:19.19,general text,,0,0,0,,from all corners of the country every day
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.78,0:49:23.65,general text,,0,0,0,,- Let's go in\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.08,0:49:38.13,italics,,0,0,0,,So you are saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.21,0:49:41.09,general text,,0,0,0,,that perhaps there are nomads in every family,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.17,0:49:43.22,general text,,0,0,0,,who participated in the murder of Nak Soo’s father,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.30,0:49:45.30,general text,,0,0,0,,and we need to use the relics of Jinyeowon,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.34,0:49:47.51,general text,,0,0,0,,to find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.60,0:49:49.81,general text,,0,0,0,,We were going to wait until the nomad,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.89,0:49:52.31,general text,,0,0,0,,from Degantongun will come to consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.39,0:49:54.19,general text,,0,0,0,,but we can’t wait any longer
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.27,0:49:55.69,general text,,0,0,0,,The fact is that
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.60,0:49:58.77,general text,,0,0,0,,last night we found another one
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.02,0:50:01.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.44,0:50:05.03,general text,,0,0,0,,A nomad who was a eunuch was found in Chonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.11,0:50:08.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu must have already visited you
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.37,0:50:13.87,general text,,0,0,0,,My brother Jin Mu said that Sosnovy Bor sent a burglar to Jeonbugwan,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.50,0:50:17.75,general text,,0,0,0,,who tried to set him up. He was very upset
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.83,0:50:20.96,general text,,0,0,0,,To find out whether Jin Mu is guilty or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.67,0:50:25.67,general text,,0,0,0,,we need the relics and powers of the head of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.76,0:50:27.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Help us
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.89,0:50:29.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.43,0:50:32.81,general text,,0,0,0,,but I refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.81,0:50:38.56,general text,,0,0,0,,There is nothing more shameful for a magician than accusations of using dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.40,0:50:40.86,general text,,0,0,0,,If we
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.94,0:50:45.19,italics,,0,0,0,,test magicians with their relics without any evidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.15,0:50:48.91,general text,,0,0,0,,we will only make people hate Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.99,0:50:50.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard, Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.20,0:50:53.91,general text,,0,0,0,,looking for your eldest daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.83,0:50:58.17,general text,,0,0,0,,He asked you not to help Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.67,0:51:00.92,general text,,0,0,0,,in exchange for help finding your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.50,0:51:03.38,general text,,0,0,0,,- This has nothing to do...{\i1}\N- No, it does
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.46,0:51:07.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Your behavior regarding Sosnovy Bor has suddenly changed
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.05,0:51:11.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to always do what you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.60,0:51:12.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this the behavior you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.39,0:51:18.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Jinyoungwon does not obey
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.39,0:51:19.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovoy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.98,0:51:21.81,general text,,0,0,0,,- Chapter Jin!\N- Leave
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.40,0:51:25.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I have an appointment
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.29,0:51:39.25,general text,,0,0,0,,When they find your big sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.33,0:51:42.75,general text,,0,0,0,,there will no longer be any barriers to our love
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.84,0:51:46.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Because Sosnovy Bor and Jinyovon have good relations
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.76,0:51:48.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.59,0:51:51.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.22,0:51:55.81,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the decoration I liked last time
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.47,0:51:58.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Someone already managed to buy it
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.85,0:52:00.44,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.52,0:52:03.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Paid that person four times the amount
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.69,0:52:05.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Thought you'd like it
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.48,0:52:07.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I really like it
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.49,0:52:11.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Your happy smile
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.32,0:52:15.03,general text,,0,0,0,,makes me the happiest in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.13,0:52:28.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Why does your uncle look so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.13,0:52:29.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.51,0:52:33.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I think he had a big fight with the head of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.95,0:52:55.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I drew a dark red mole behind her ear
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.99,0:53:01.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Boo Young fell as a child. She has a scar on her left arm
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.58,0:53:06.04,general text,,0,0,0,,About a third of a finger long
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.41,0:53:41.58,general text,,0,0,0,,It is necessary for you to become Jin Bu Young, be patient
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.66,0:53:44.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Every scar, every mole...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.58,0:53:47.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Any little thing her mother can remember
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.67,0:53:50.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.84,0:53:54.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I will pour acid on your skin to make the scar more visible
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.09,0:54:41.51,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of fish is young Mr. Chan trying to catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.60,0:54:43.35,general text,,0,0,0,,All he does is go to the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.93,0:54:46.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to take them food
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.56,0:54:48.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I will ask servant Li to carry
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.65,0:54:50.77,general text,,0,0,0,,And you stay and help me
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.61,0:54:56.53,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to clean the house and prepare food for the memorial service
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.03,0:54:59.28,general text,,0,0,0,,For whose?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.36,0:55:01.58,general text,,0,0,0,,A young girl who died a terrible death
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.08,0:55:04.33,general text,,0,0,0,,She was offended by our family,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.41,0:55:06.41,general text,,0,0,0,,so I want to hold a wake for her
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.96,0:55:09.29,italics,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.37,0:55:10.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I returned from the temple
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.96,0:55:12.13,general text,,0,0,0,,- Okay\N- Here
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.21,0:55:14.55,general text,,0,0,0,,A Buddhist monk wrote a speech
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.88,0:55:17.59,general text,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful speech
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.68,0:55:20.30,general text,,0,0,0,,But where are their names?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.39,0:55:22.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I should have written the names of the spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.64,0:55:23.93,italics,,0,0,0,,Here they are
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.01,0:55:26.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Right here. Cho Chun and Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.14,0:55:30.35,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Cho Young? This is my name
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.94,0:55:32.94,italics,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's it. Now I see
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.02,0:55:34.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Chun and Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.98,0:55:37.32,italics,,0,0,0,,Wonderful speech
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.40,0:55:39.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Li, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.32,0:55:41.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring the food to the master
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.99,0:55:43.12,italics,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.62,0:55:46.70,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim conducts a wake
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.54,0:55:49.62,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,about me and my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.16,0:56:30.54,general text,,0,0,0,,They brought us rice with mushrooms. My favorite
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.62,0:56:33.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Maid Kim is a great cook
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.09,0:56:42.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Pecks! I caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.02,0:56:55.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I hooked a worm. She fell for him
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.65,0:56:58.23,general text,,0,0,0,,We can eat her
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.78,0:57:05.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.01,0:57:24.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Hold
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.93,0:57:31.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Take your time
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.23,0:57:35.81,general text,,0,0,0,,One day you will feel this feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.90,0:57:38.27,general text,,0,0,0,,when the golden fish bites
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.36,0:57:41.94,general text,,0,0,0,,This will be Chisu - the ability to control energy
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.65,0:57:44.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I see
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.74,0:57:48.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li, you taught me to read “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.41,0:57:51.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you continue to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.96,0:57:55.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Accidentally for no reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.33,0:57:59.38,general text,,0,0,0,,which should be kept secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.30,0:58:02.76,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s none of your business
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.84,0:58:04.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you think I wouldn’t find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.05,0:58:08.51,general text,,0,0,0,,This concerns my family
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.52,0:58:15.10,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s because of the maid Kim, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.02,0:58:20.32,general text,,0,0,0,,You constantly shower her with compliments
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.40,0:58:22.73,general text,,0,0,0,,And you also have a scarf around your neck...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.82,0:58:25.11,general text,,0,0,0,,He’s from the shop she goes to
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.15,0:58:27.36,general text,,0,0,0,,This is her gift, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.41,0:58:29.62,general text,,0,0,0,,And most importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.70,0:58:33.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw dried wildflowers in the room of the maid Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.50,0:58:35.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Danhyangok is full of them
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.83,0:58:37.37,general text,,0,0,0,,And this is your gift, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.96,0:58:41.59,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes, it’s true\N- That’s what I knew
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.92,0:58:44.97,general text,,0,0,0,,But you practice chastity...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.05,0:58:48.30,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t have “those” feelings for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.89,0:58:51.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I think she is beautiful and kind-hearted
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.60,0:58:53.02,general text,,0,0,0,,That's all
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.56,0:58:56.60,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s the same as confessing your feelings for her
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.69,0:58:58.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Relationships between men and women are always “like this”
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.31,0:59:00.19,general text,,0,0,0,,And what about yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.86,0:59:03.90,general text,,0,0,0,,You are a man, and Moo Dok is a woman. What's between you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.90,0:59:07.49,general text,,0,0,0,,As for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.11,0:59:10.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I like her
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.75,0:59:18.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe I’m saying this to someone who practices chastity
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.79,0:59:22.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Only the maid Kim already likes someone
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.34,0:59:23.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope I didn’t hurt your feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.80,0:59:25.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I also have to say
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.21,0:59:28.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that Moo Deok likes Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.93,0:59:31.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu told you this? What kind of conversation is this worldly?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.60,0:59:33.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m not just messing with you here
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.64,0:59:37.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I realized that worldly conversations...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.14,0:59:40.02,general text,,0,0,0,,sometimes useful
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.15,0:59:44.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the story of Julia’s first love,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.32,0:59:47.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I was able to find out about Nak Su, the killer
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.24,0:59:53.24,general text,,0,0,0,,The girl he met in Danhyangok,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.33,0:59:55.70,general text,,0,0,0,,turned out to be Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.83,0:59:58.29,general text,,0,0,0,,He realized that it was her...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.37,1:00:01.08,general text,,0,0,0,,because of the whistle he was given. He lay next to her body
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.29,1:00:07.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I know you overheard my conversation with Jin in Sejukwon
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.09,1:00:12.72,general text,,0,0,0,,So you yourself know about the history of Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.52,1:00:18.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Come home early today
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.35,1:00:20.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim holds a wake...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.73,1:00:25.11,general text,,0,0,0,,on a little girl who died a terrible death
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.58,1:00:42.96,general text,,0,0,0,,That's all
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.54,1:00:44.88,general text,,0,0,0,,The bowl of constellations is installed
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.96,1:00:47.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Take your servants back to Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.00,1:00:51.13,general text,,0,0,0,,No, not perfect yet
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.22,1:00:52.68,general text,,0,0,0,,We like everything
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.76,1:00:54.01,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.09,1:00:55.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Just take a look
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.55,1:00:59.35,general text,,0,0,0,,The colors of the bowl and stem are different
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.93,1:01:01.98,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to change the leg
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.06,1:01:04.10,general text,,0,0,0,,We have already changed it many times
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.60,1:01:05.94,general text,,0,0,0,,We like everything
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.02,1:01:07.44,general text,,0,0,0,,The Head of Sosnovy Bor promised,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.52,1:01:10.40,general text,,0,0,0,,which will return everything as it was
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.99,1:01:12.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Mistakes must not be made
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.28,1:01:16.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Usually it takes no more than two days
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.58,1:01:19.20,general text,,0,0,0,,But this time everything was somehow delayed
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.29,1:01:21.66,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t like us coming here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.75,1:01:23.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Why would this be?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.75,1:01:28.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I just think that Sosnovy Bor is wasting time and money
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.22,1:01:35.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry about Sosnovy Bor’s money
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.68,1:01:40.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, last time we met I noted your skills
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.47,1:01:42.14,italics,,0,0,0,,Already mastered Chisu?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.98,1:01:45.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.15,1:01:48.40,general text,,0,0,0,,It turns out that you are the first magician of Jeonjingak,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.48,1:01:50.65,general text,,0,0,0,,possessed Chisu
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.28,1:01:54.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything like my father. Seo Il must be very proud of you
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.32,1:01:57.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Is he a magician of Jeonjingak?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.74,1:02:00.79,memories italics,,0,0,0,,You cannot drag a person against his will
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.25,1:02:07.92,memories,,0,0,0,,Can you stand up?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.17,1:02:11.30,italics,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.55,1:02:16.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Is he a magician of Jeonjingak?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.72,1:02:19.18,general text,,0,0,0,,- His name is Seo Yul?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.26,1:02:21.93,general text,,0,0,0,,They are the sons of noble families, the berries are not of your field
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.52,1:02:24.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop wandering here, sit quietly
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.90,1:02:33.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe the thief So And is no match for him
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.03,1:02:39.95,general text,,0,0,0,,But as soon as I become Jin Bu Young, the future head of Jinyoung,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.62,1:02:43.16,general text,,0,0,0,,everything can change
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.92,1:02:54.63,general text,,0,0,0,,This is for Master Chan's friend and his daughter
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.97,1:02:58.72,italics,,0,0,0,,Their bodies were not buried,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.72,1:03:02.22,italics,,0,0,0,,and hardly anyone remembers them
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.97,1:03:04.81,general text,,0,0,0,,So I will hold at least one service
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.73,1:03:07.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.73,1:03:11.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.02,1:03:14.32,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.44,1:03:17.90,general text,,0,0,0,,They would be very grateful to you
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.99,1:03:21.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they are very grateful
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.12,1:03:24.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear that
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.41,1:03:28.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Do not put out the incense sticks until they burn out
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.69,1:03:58.90,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Cho Chun, Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.50,1:04:19.47,captions,,0,0,0,,Cho Chun, Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.60,1:04:28.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.15,1:04:43.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Chan went fishing
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.37,1:04:46.08,general text,,0,0,0,,He'll be back soon, you can wait inside
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.58,1:04:49.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok went with him?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.50,1:04:51.71,general text,,0,0,0,,No, she's home
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.79,1:04:53.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Helped with the wake
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.81,1:05:10.23,captions,,0,0,0,,Cho Chun, Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.81,1:05:14.15,offscreen,,0,0,0,,If I had not left you...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.48,1:05:17.07,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,alone in the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.90,1:05:25.03,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,you wouldn’t have to hold back your tears right now
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.87,1:05:28.24,offscreen,,0,0,0,,and pretend to be someone else
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.58,1:05:35.17,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,But even now,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.17,1:05:39.63,offscreen,,0,0,0,,I can’t come near...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.59,1:05:42.63,voiceover,,0,0,0,,and tell you that I know who you are
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.69,1:05:57.31,captions,,0,0,0,,Cho Chun, Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.40,1:06:04.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Are the sticks burnt out?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.28,1:06:07.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.99,1:06:09.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Burned out
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.62,1:06:10.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you been sitting here?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.04,1:06:15.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's clean everything up
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.29,1:06:58.21,general text,,0,0,0,,When did you return? I heard you went fishing
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.29,1:07:00.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, just returned
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.42,1:07:01.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you alone? Where is Dan Gu?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.84,1:07:04.59,general text,,0,0,0,,He has something to do. I think he's dating someone
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.67,1:07:05.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.18,1:07:08.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you come?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.51,1:07:11.51,general text,,0,0,0,,The head said that you can come back
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.10,1:07:14.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Faster than I thought
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.48,1:07:18.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Sit down and have a drink. I still needed to talk to you
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.77,1:07:20.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t, sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.15,1:07:23.69,general text,,0,0,0,,- I need to return to Sosnovy Bor\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.78,1:07:26.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Then we’ll talk later, in Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.45,1:07:29.16,general text,,0,0,0,,You will be very surprised
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.82,1:07:34.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk, I'll be back to Soho Fortress soon
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.16,1:07:38.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I promised my father that I would stay in Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.12,1:07:40.71,general text,,0,0,0,,until I master Chisu
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.42,1:07:43.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Ho wrote a letter to his father,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.96,1:07:45.84,general text,,0,0,0,,so soon he will tell me to come back
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.42,1:07:47.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I will have to leave
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.59,1:07:49.18,general text,,0,0,0,,But the Soho fortress is very far away
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.05,1:07:52.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu and I will miss you very much
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.64,1:07:56.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to take it with me
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.02,1:07:59.85,general text,,0,0,0,,someone
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.56,1:08:04.52,general text,,0,0,0,,- Who?\N- I can’t say yet
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.65,1:08:07.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll tell you when the time comes
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.15,1:08:11.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll go. See you tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.99,1:08:14.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay. Bye
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.36,1:08:49.78,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Because I was bored
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.86,1:08:51.95,memories,,0,0,0,,I really liked this person
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.74,1:08:58.75,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Nomads can only recover by sucking out someone else’s energy
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.83,1:09:00.12,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Having done this once,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.21,1:09:02.79,memories italics,,0,0,0,,they turn into monsters
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.00,1:09:05.92,memories italics,,0,0,0,,And our task is
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.88,1:09:08.21,memories italics,,0,0,0,,protect the world from them
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.26,1:09:14.43,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Does Yul really know about everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.72,1:09:17.56,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I want to take it with me
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.14,1:09:20.02,memories,,0,0,0,,someone
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.56,1:09:27.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Host
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.98,1:09:29.11,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.15,1:09:35.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Has So Yul already left? Maid Kim gave it to him
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.33,1:09:43.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Looks like he was talking about you
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.71,1:09:47.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Who? Did Seo Yul say something?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.21,1:09:52.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I can go back
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.72,1:09:55.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that why you are so upset?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.84,1:09:57.93,general text,,0,0,0,,When you return to the forest,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.47,1:10:00.93,general text,,0,0,0,,your duel with Cha Bum will take place
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.02,1:10:02.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid to lose?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.02,1:10:04.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t lose tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.27,1:10:08.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Finally I got it
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.83,1:10:30.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Today is Chan Wook’s last fight
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.17,1:10:35.43,general text,,0,0,0,,We have slightly changed the betting conditions
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.51,1:10:37.26,general text,,0,0,0,,The winner of today's match
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.09,1:10:40.39,general text,,0,0,0,,will receive not a golden toad, but something else
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.82,1:10:56.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Winner
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.78,1:10:59.07,general text,,0,0,0,,will win the maid
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.41,1:11:07.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I agreed to serve that,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.00,1:11:11.21,general text,,0,0,0,,who will win today
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.85,1:11:23.01,general text,,0,0,0,,- What's going on?\N{\i1} - Excellent
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.68,1:11:25.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Wook's last opponent,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.06,1:11:27.02,general text,,0,0,0,,come forward
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.46,1:11:56.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.30,1:12:00.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Today fight with you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.30,1:12:02.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll be there
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.02,1:13:01.99,preview,,0,0,0,,Uk can bring chaos to this world
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.07,1:13:04.28,preview,,0,0,0,,What happens if he attracts attention?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.37,1:13:06.20,preview,,0,0,0,,We must choose the one who will definitely win
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.28,1:13:08.79,preview,,0,0,0,,I will win and take her with me as a maid
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.87,1:13:12.75,preview,,0,0,0,,Has he mastered the techniques of the previous nine opponents?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.83,1:13:13.79,preview,,0,0,0,,I have to find him
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.88,1:13:15.00,preview,,0,0,0,,Then you have to lose something
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.08,1:13:17.09,preview,,0,0,0,,Your reverent love did not surrender to anyone
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.17,1:13:20.01,preview,,0,0,0,,Only then will I be able to look into his eyes without shame
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.09,1:13:23.84,preview,,0,0,0,,Ask around about Moo Deok. What kind of girl is she
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.93,1:13:26.10,preview,,0,0,0,,"A look filled with tenderness", same to me
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.18,1:13:27.35,preview,,0,0,0,,You don’t consider me a woman
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.43,1:13:29.93,preview,,0,0,0,,- Don’t regret it later\N- Okay, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.14,1:13:34.81,preview,,0,0,0,,I really like you, master
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:02:59.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,

